-date>cited 2006 Oct 16</access-date><comment>Available from:<ext-link ext-link-type="uri" xlink:href="http://www.pedbikeinfo.org/programs.htm">http://www.pedbikeinfo.org/programs.htm</ext-link></comment></citation></ref><ref id="B8"><label>8</label><citation citation-type="book"><source>2007 to bring sharp reductions in artificial trans fat: restaurants respond to laws, litigation, &#x00026; consumer demand [Press release]</source><publisher-loc>Washington (DC)</publisher-loc><publisher-name>Center for Science in the Public Interest</publisher-name><year>2006</year><month>12</month><day>29</day><comment>Available from:<ext-link ext-link-type="uri" xlink:href="http://www.cspinet.org/new/200612291.html">http://www.cspinet.org/new/200612291.html</ext-link></comment></citation></ref><ref id="B9"><label>9</label><citation citation-type="book"><source>Information [Internet]</source><publisher-loc>Silver Spring (MD)</publisher-loc><publisher-name>The Obesity Society</publisher-name><access-date>cited 2006 Oct 16</access-date><comment>Available from:<ext-link ext-link-type="uri" xlink:href="http://www.naaso.org/information">http://www.naaso.org/information</ext-link></comment></citation></ref><ref id="B10"><label>10</label><citation citation-type="book"><source>Dietary Guidelines for Americans 2005</source><publisher-loc>Rockville (MD)</publisher-loc><publisher-name>U.S. Department of Health and Human Services, U.S. Department of Agriculture</publisher-name><access-date>cited 2006 Oct 16</access-date><comment>Available from:<ext-link ext-link-type="uri" xlink:href="http://www.healthierus.gov/dietaryguidelines">http://www.healthierus.gov/dietaryguidelines</ext-link></comment></citation></ref><ref id="B11"><label>11</label><citation citation-type="book"><source>Guide to Community Preventive Services. Obesity</source><publisher-name>Centers for Disease Control and Prevention</publisher-name><publisher-loc>Atlanta (GA)</publisher-loc><access-date>cited 2006 Oct 16</access-date