ource>CA Cancer J Clin</source><comment>[Published erratum in: CA Cancer J Clin 2007;57(1):66]</comment><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">17005596</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="B14"><label>14</label><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Foxhall</surname><given-names>K</given-names></name></person-group><volume>96</volume><issue>12</issue><year>2006</year><fpage>2106</fpage><lpage>2112</lpage><article-title>Beginning to begin: reports from the battle on obesity</article-title><source>Am J Public Health</source><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">17077404</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="B15"><label>15</label><citation citation-type="book"><source>Internet resources [Internet]</source><publisher-loc>New Haven (CT)</publisher-loc><publisher-name>Rudd Center for Food Policy and Obesity at Yale University</publisher-name><access-date>cited 2006 Oct 16</access-date><comment>Available from:<ext-link ext-link-type="uri" xlink:href="http://www.yaleruddcenter.org/default.aspx?id=17#opr">http://www.yaleruddcenter.org/default.aspx?id=17#opr</ext-link></comment></citation></ref></ref-list><fn-group><fn><p>The opinions expressed by authors contributing to this journal do not necessarily reflect the opinions of the U.S. Department of Health and Human Services, the Public Health Service, Centers for Disease Control and Prevention, or the authors' affiliated institutions. Use of trade names is for identification only and does not imply endorsement by any of the groups named above.</p></fn><fn><p>					<italic>Suggested citation for this article:</italic> Sparling PB. Obesity on campus. Prev Chronic Dis [serial online] 2007 Jul [date cited]. Available from <ext-link ext-link-type="uri" xlink:href="http://www.cdc.gov/pcd/issues/2007/jul/06_0142.htm">http://www.cdc.gov/pcd/issues/2007/jul/06_0142.htm</ext-link>				</p></fn></fn-group></back></article>